====== NETGEAR R6200 v1======

{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

The NETGEAR R6200v1 is a WiFi Router based on the BCM4718 SOC and BCM53125 Switch. The 5GHz WiFi chipset is a BCM4352, unsupported, and might be replaceable with any mini-PCIe card.

