===== Specific Configuration =====

==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description                  ^ Default configuration    ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi                   | 192.168.1.1/24           |
| vlan0 (eth0.0)   | LAN ports (1 to 4)           | None                     |
| vlan1 (eth0.1)   | WAN port                     | DHCP                     |
| wlan0            | WiFi                         | Disabled                 |
==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| CPU (eth0)       | 8     |
| Internet (WAN)   | 4     |
| LAN 1            | 3     |
| LAN 2            | 2     |
| LAN 3            | 1     |
| LAN 4            | 0     |
==== Buttons ====
The Netgear R6200 v1 has the following buttons:

^ BUTTON                                     ^ Event   ^
| WiFi On/Off (Side, Upper Button)           |   rfkill  |
| WiFi Protected Setup (Side, Lower Button)  |   ses   |
| Reset (On Back)                            |  reset  |

